<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BHP oil output up in October.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BHP oil output up in October.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Pty Co Ltd (BHP) said on Tuesady its oil/condensate production increased during October largely as a result of production from Liverpool Bay in the Irish Sea.</p>
<p>BHP said in its monthly production report that gas production was lower partly due to the sale of its North American gas producing assets.</p>
<p>Production from Liverpool Bay averaged 35,000 barrels of oil per day (bopd) gross, with BHP's share at 16,200 bopd, it said.  </p>
